Ignored by colcon on purpose, for now.

These are plain cargo crates. Making them build as ROS 2 packages needs ros2_rust
(colcon-cargo + cargo-ament-build), which is not installed and is its own setup task.
Until that is done they build with `cargo build` and colcon skips them, so
`colcon build` on the workspace still succeeds.

Delete this file once ros2_rust is set up.
